                        </a>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- MESSAGE -->

                <div class="dropdown">

                    <a href="/#message" class="dropbtn">
                        MESSAGE
                        <span class="arrow">▼</span>
                    </a>

                    <div class="dropdown-content">

                        <a href="/message/alumni">
                            Alumni
                        </a>

                        <a href="/message/student">
                            Student
                        </a>

                        <a href="/message/other">
                            Other
                        </a>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- ACADEMICS -->

                <div class="dropdown">

                    <a href="/#academics" class="dropbtn">
                        ACADEMICS
                        <span class="arrow">▼</span>
                    </a>

                    <div class="dropdown-content">

                        <a href="/#academics">
                            Programs
                        </a>

                        <a href="/#academics">
                            Departments
                        </a>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <!-- CONTACT US -->

                <div class="dropdown">

                    <a href="/#contact" class="dropbtn">
                        CONTACT US
                        <span class="arrow">▼</span>
                    </a>

                    <div class="dropdown-content">

                        <a href="/#contact">
                            Enquiry
                        </a>

                        <a href="/#contact">
                            Address
                        </a>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- SEARCH -->

            <div class="nav-search">

                <input
                    type="text"
                    id="navSearch"
                    placeholder="Search..."
                >

                <button onclick="searchWebsite()">
                    🔍
                </button>

            </div>

        </nav>


        <!-- LOGIN -->

        <div class="nav-buttons">

            <button onclick="openLogin()">
                Login
            </button>

            <button
                class="join-btn"
                onclick="openRegister()"
            >
                Join Network
            </button>

        </div>

    </header>


    <!-- ================= DIRECTOR CONTENT ================= -->

    <section class="inner-page">

        <h1>
            Director's Message
        </h1>

        <p class="subtitle">
            "Guiding Students Towards a Successful Future"
        </p>


        <!-- ================= IMAGE 1 ================= -->

        <div class="director-image-block">

            <img
                src="/images/director.png.jpeg"
                alt="Director - Prestige College"
            >

            <div class="image-caption">

                Director Sir

                <span>
                    Prestige Institute of Management and Research, Bhopal
                </span>

            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- ================= DYNAMIC EDUCATIONAL LEADER ================= -->

        <div class="content-section">

            <h2>
                A Dynamic Educational Leader
            </h2>

            <p>
                Our Director Sir is a dynamic educational leader whose passion for teaching
                and commitment to academic excellence have transformed Prestige Institute of
                Management and Research into a hub of innovation and learning. With years of
                experience in the field of education and management, he has brought fresh
                ideas, modern teaching methodologies, and a student-centric approach to the
                institution.
            </p>

            <p>
                Under his able guidance, PIMR has introduced industry-oriented programs,
                enhanced research activities, and strengthened its placement records. His
                vision is to prepare students not just for jobs, but for meaningful careers
                and leadership roles in society.
            </p>


            <div class="highlight-box">

                <p>
                    "Our goal is to nurture not just skilled professionals,
                    but also compassionate human beings."
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- ================= IMAGE 2 ================= -->

        <div class="director-image-block">

            <img
                src="/images/director1.png.jpeg"
                alt="Director - Prestige College"
            >

            <div class="image-caption">

                Director Sir with Students

                <span>
                    Inspiring excellence and innovation
                </span>

            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- ================= MENTOR ================= -->

        <div class="content-section">

            <h2>
                A Mentor and Motivator
            </h2>

            <p>
                Our Director Sir is a mentor who believes in the potential of every student.
                He is approachable, encouraging, and always ready to guide students in their
                academic and professional journeys. His regular interactions with students,
                his focus on holistic development, and his emphasis on ethical values have
                made him a beloved figure on campus.
            </p>

            <p>
                He actively encourages students to participate in research, internships, and
                co-curricular activities that help them grow beyond the classroom. His belief
                is simple — education should prepare students for life, not just for exams.
            </p>

        </div>


        <!-- ================= KEY CONTRIBUTIONS ================= -->

        <div class="content-section">

            <h2>
                Key Contributions
            </h2>

            <ul>

                <li>
                    Introduced modern, industry-oriented academic programs.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Enhanced the institute's research and innovation ecosystem.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Strengthened industry partnerships and placement opportunities.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Promoted digital learning and smart classroom initiatives.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Fostered a culture of entrepreneurship and leadership among students.
                </li>

            </ul>

        </div>


        <!-- ================= MESSAGE ================= -->

        <div class="content-section">

            <h2>
                Message to Students & Alumni
            </h2>

            <p>
                Our Director Sir always reminds students and alumni that success is a journey,
                not a destination. He encourages everyone to stay curious, keep learning, and
                contribute to the growth of society. He believes that the Alumni Connect Portal
                is a powerful platform that can bring together students, alumni, and the
                institution to create lasting value.
            </p>


            <div class="highlight-box">

                <p>
                    🌟 "Dream big, work hard, and stay connected with your roots."
                    — Director Sir
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- ================= SIGNATURE ================= -->

        <div class="signature-box">

            <strong>
                Director
            </strong>

            <span>
                Prestige Institute of Management and Research, Bhopal
            </span>

        </div>


        <!-- ================= BACK TO HOME ================= -->

        <a href="/" class="back-btn">
            ← Back to Home
        </a>

    </section>


    <!-- ================= JAVASCRIPT ================= -->

    <script src="/js/script-new.js"></script>

</body>
